sequenceDiagram
    participant CD as Claude Desktop
    participant srv as server.py<br/>(stdio transport)
    participant reg as Tool Registry

    Note over CD,srv: Session startup — MCP handshake
    CD->>srv: initialize {protocolVersion: "2024-11-05", clientInfo: {...}}
    srv-->>CD: {serverInfo: {name: "knowledge-base"}, capabilities: {tools: {}}}

    CD->>srv: tools/list
    srv->>reg: List registered tools
    reg-->>srv: [search_docs, list_docs]
    srv-->>CD: tools/list response<br/>{tools: [{name, description, inputSchema}, ...]}

    Note over CD,srv: Runtime — user asks a question
    CD->>srv: tools/call {name: "search_docs", arguments: {query: "..."}}
    srv->>srv: Embed query → query ChromaDB → format results
    srv-->>CD: {content: [{type: "text", text: "...citations..."}]}

    CD->>srv: tools/call {name: "list_docs", arguments: {}}
    srv->>srv: List all source files in ChromaDB collection
    srv-->>CD: {content: [{type: "text", text: "api-reference.md\nrunbook.md\n..."}]}
